problem:
Let $a, b$, and $c$ be pairwise distinct nonzero complex numbers such that

$$
\begin{aligned}
& (10 a+b)(10 a+c)=a+\frac{1}{a} \\
& (10 b+a)(10 b+c)=b+\frac{1}{b} \\
& (10 c+a)(10 c+b)=c+\frac{1}{c}
\end{aligned}
