\$\$\begin{aligned}

E_{a, b} \& =\frac{a-1}{a+b-1}\left(E_{a-2, b}+1\right)+\frac{b}{a+b-1} E_{a-1, b-1} <br>
\& =\frac{(a-1)\left(E_{a-2, b}+1\right)+b E_{a-1, b-1}}{a+b-1}

